special.js contains gamma/digamma kernels from TyMC (Apache-2.0),
Copyright 2026 Benjamin F. Maier / PyMC Labs.
Source: https://github.com/pymc-labs/tymc/blob/b1c038979eb006b2d9ad1842a5b9ec2640688944/src/numerics/special_scalar.ts
It includes the Cephes-derived kernels and TyMC's fitted Stirling correction.
The Apache-2.0 license is supplied in special.LICENSE.

wasm_kernels.js adapts TyMC's numerical WASM/SIMD assemblers at the same
revision, Copyright 2026 Benjamin F. Maier / PyMC Labs (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/pymc-labs/tymc/tree/b1c038979eb006b2d9ad1842a5b9ec2640688944/src/graph
Sources: wasm_linalg.ts, wasm_trsm.ts and wasm_cholesky.ts. Assemblers are
isolated in closures; TyMC graph/record adapters are omitted. PyTensor's
staging adapters are in wasm_runtime.js. The license is in special.LICENSE.

